### EventHub Microservices REST API Endpoints (VS Code REST Client)
### Base Gateway URL: http://localhost:8080

### ==========================================
### 1. USER & AUTHENTICATION SERVICE (Member 1)
### ==========================================

### 1.1 Register New User
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Demo User",
  "email": "demouser100@gmail.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

### 1.2 User Login (Obtain JWT Access Token)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demouser100@gmail.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

### 1.3 List All Users
GET http://localhost:8080/users


### ==========================================
### 2. EVENT MANAGEMENT SERVICE (Member 2)
### ==========================================

### 2.1 List All Events
GET http://localhost:8080/events

### 2.2 Search Events by Title / Location
GET http://localhost:8080/events/search?query=Tech

### 2.3 Check Event Seat Availability
GET http://localhost:8082/events/100001/availability
X-API-KEY: event-service-secret-key-12345


### ==========================================
### 3. TICKET BOOKING SERVICE (Member 3)
### ==========================================

### 3.1 Create Ticket Booking
POST http://localhost:8080/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": 100001,
  "userId": 100001,
  "tickets": 2,
  "unitPrice": 4500.00,
  "totalAmount": 9000.00
}

### 3.2 Get Bookings by User ID
GET http://localhost:8080/bookings/user/100001


### ==========================================
### 4. PAYMENT & NOTIFICATION SERVICE (Member 4 & 5)
### ==========================================

### 4.1 Process Payment for Booking
POST http://localhost:8080/payments/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": 100001,
  "userId": 100001,
  "amount": 9000.00,
  "paymentMethod": "CREDIT_CARD"
}

### 4.2 List All Notifications
GET http://localhost:8080/notifications
